the conference actually.

00:54:03.160 --> 00:54:05.480
And unfortunately he passed away

00:54:05.480 --> 00:54:07.440
just a couple of months after that.

00:54:07.440 --> 00:54:09.120
He would have loved to have been here.

00:54:09.120 --> 00:54:12.113
Many of you have met him and knew him.

00:54:14.360 --> 00:54:18.580
He in many ways encapsulated
this whole period

00:54:18.580 --> 00:54:19.990
that we've been talking about.

00:54:19.990 --> 00:54:24.910
He was born and raised in Indonesia,

00:54:24.910 --> 00:54:26.990
and he was ethnic Chinese.

00:54:26.990 --> 00:54:29.620
He was persecuted for
being ethnic Chinese,

00:54:29.620 --> 00:54:31.750
as was his wife Francesca.

00:54:31.750 --> 00:54:33.570
Who's in the middle photo there.

00:54:33.570 --> 00:54:35.450
He later joined the UN.

00:54:35.450 --> 00:54:39.390
He was the Governor of
Siem Reap for the UN,

00:54:39.390 --> 00:54:40.233
for UNTAC.

00:54:41.226 --> 00:54:44.293
And later became the Special
Representative of the UN

00:54:46.820 --> 00:54:48.540
to Cambodia during those years.

00:54:48.540 --> 00:54:50.110
And that's him.

00:54:50.110 --> 00:54:52.580
We can't see in the picture,

00:54:52.580 --> 00:54:57.580
but he's standing there
